  <p>
    A gap year after graduation is not automatically a risk or automatically a reset - it is whatever you build inside it. If the pause is really about not knowing which direction to head once it ends, <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/">structured career guidance</a> can help you use the time to actually decide, instead of just waiting it out.
